 <name>Config_Lite</name>
 <channel>pear.php.net</channel>
 <summary>a lightweight and fast Config class for ini style text configuration files.</summary>
 <description>This package defines a class for config/settings text files in ini style.
		Currently classes available are:
		* Config_Lite: a class with arrayaccess to handle ini style files
		* Config_Lite_Exception: Interface implemented by Exceptions</description>
